  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">A massive, quiescent galaxy at redshift of z=3.717 (2017) in Leiden Repository (Leiden University).</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">A massive, quiescent galaxy at redshift of z=3.717 (2017) in Leiden Repository (Leiden University) is authored by Glazebrook, Karl, Schreiber, Corentin and Labb\u00e9, Ivo. Topics: Physics, Astrophysics, Galaxy, Astronomy and Billion years.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No citations yet.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
